============================================================
V3.0 - KEY CHANGES FROM V2.0
============================================================

V2:
`Scenario strength = marginal transition SSI`

V3:
`Scenario strength = exact-profile whole-scenario history shrunk toward marginal prior`

V2:
`candidate evidence mainly independent per number/family`

V3:
`CandidateJoint = independent evidence plus confidence-weighted exact-profile context`

V2:
`pair diversity = whether the portfolio has already used a pair`

V3:
`pair compatibility = historical candidate-normalized co-win evidence under the exact profile`

V2:
`coverage could dominate ticket quality`

V3:
`COVERAGE must stay within 95% of the best JointTicketScore for its scenario`

V2:
`DEEP could select weak tickets merely to reach weight-1 candidates`

V3:
`DEEP must stay within 90% of the best JointTicketScore for its scenario`

V2:
`scenario ID ordering was implicit`

V3:
`scenario IDs are explicitly lexicographic EH/H/W/C rank tuples`

V2:
`Cross-Family Assembly Ceiling was undefined`

V3:
`Cross-Family Assembly Ceiling has an exact pairwise frozen-portfolio definition`

